### Backend health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Health through the Vite dev proxy
GET http://localhost:5173/actuator/health

### ---- SlotMind demo path (backend on :8080) ----

### Book a patient (use an OPEN slot id from GET /slots)
POST http://localhost:8080/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientName": "Maria Lopez", "type": "ROUTINE", "providerId": "PRV-004", "slotId": "SLT-005" }

### Open slots
GET http://localhost:8080/slots?status=OPEN

### Trigger: Dr. Chen goes offline (returns at once, planning is asynchronous)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/providers/PRV-001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OFFLINE" }

### The queue: suggestions appear after a moment
GET http://localhost:8080/appointments?status=RESCHEDULE_PENDING

### On-demand suggestion (409 PENDING_SUGGESTION_EXISTS if the loop already made one)
POST http://localhost:8080/appointments/APT-001/suggest?strategy=rule

### Accept (replace the id; the second accept of the same slot returns 409 SLOT_NOT_OPEN)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/suggestions/SUG-REPLACE-ME
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACCEPTED" }

### Cancel a slot (second trigger)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/slots/SLT-002/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELLED" }
